{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"python .codex/skills/memory-log/scripts/append_memory.py --local-memory-md ./memory.md --global-memory-md ./global_memory/memory.md --global-memory-jsonl ./global_memory/memory.jsonl --event-json '{\\\"step\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Selected a condition-dependent residual-scale evaluation story rather than a latent-count bridge, universal superiority, or a search chronology.\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Read final_evaluation independently: final.qualification.status=completed, outcome=qualified, correct=true; six final seed episodes contain H/B/S cases in dimensions 3/10, fixed-group coverage, reference mass, baselines, and paired bootstrap intervals. Homoscedastic utility is not improved consistently; boundary heteroscedasticity supports useful local scaling. Shift results do not establish exchangeability or validity. No downstream_study, previous_paper, aggregated, extra_tasks, or resolved edit-context input is present. Original ridge-scale comparator lacks a matched final evaluation. ICLR paper.sty is single-column, 5.5in by 9in. apply_patch is not installed or exposed; required new outputs will use direct filesystem creation, without rewriting existing artifacts.\\\",\\\"next_action\\\":\\\"Write matched strategy JSON and memo with direct comparison figures, main-text subgroup evidence and limitations, an 8.5-page body plan, and grounded supplementary sections; validate strategy only, not final paper.\\\"}'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
