{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"python - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nstrategy_path=Path('paper_strategy.json')\nstrategy=json.loads(strategy_path.read_text())\nllm_section=strategy['supplementary_plan']['planned_subsections'][-1]\nllm_section['source_ids']=[]\nllm_section['grounded_content']='Disclose the evidenced roles of LLMs in the current framing interaction and available proposal, source-editing and reference-query process artifacts, then add the precise writing role when it occurs. This is process provenance, not an episode-derived scientific result, so no paper_data result source ID is assigned. Inspect actual logs before attributing additional roles or model versions; do not assert unrecorded manual verification or completed experiments. Record prohibited-literature encounters only if documented; this strategy made no network requests.'\nstrategy['notes_for_writer'][-2]='Supplementary source_ids are registered result anchors for the numerical evidence; implementation, resource and process statements additionally name their actual documentary sources and are not recast as measured findings. LLM Usage deliberately has an empty source_ids list because it is grounded in process artifacts and this interaction, not in a paper_data scientific-result entry. No definitive posthoc analysis ranking is assigned; route the separately authoritative appendix-ranked analyses to Supplementary Information without revising this plan retroactively.'\nstrategy_path.write_text(json.dumps(strategy,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nmemo_path=Path('paper_strategy.md')\nmemo=memo_path.read_text()\nmemo=memo.replace('7. **LLM Usage.** Required separate section. Precisely disclose evidenced assistance in ideation, source editing, query planning, framing and writing, without guessing models, claiming manual checks or calling unexecuted experiments completed. Consult actual process logs and the current framing record; final episodes are only context, not proof of every process detail. Record prohibited-literature encounters only if documented. No network request or prohibited-literature encounter occurred during this strategy stage.', '7. **LLM Usage.** Required separate section. Disclose assistance evidenced by the current framing interaction and available proposal, source-editing and reference-query process artifacts; add the precise writing role when it occurs. Inspect actual logs before attributing further roles or model versions. Do not claim unrecorded manual checks or call unexecuted experiments completed. Its JSON \"'`source_ids` list is intentionally empty: process provenance is not grounded in a scientific-result episode. Record prohibited-literature encounters only if documented. This strategy made no network requests.'\"')\nmemo_path.write_text(memo)\nassert strategy['central_thesis'] in memo\nsources=json.loads(Path('paper_data.json').read_text())['grounding_sources']\nfor section in strategy['supplementary_plan']['planned_subsections']:\n assert all(source in sources for source in section['source_ids'])\n assert section['source_ids'] or section['heading']=='LLM Usage'\nprint('PASS: all numerical supplementary anchors resolve; LLM provenance is not falsely attributed to scientific results.')\nPY\npython .codex/skills/memory-log/scripts/append_memory.py --local-memory-md ./memory.md --global-memory-md \\\"\"'$(readlink -f global_memory)/memory.md\" --global-memory-jsonl \"$(readlink -f global_memory)/memory.jsonl\" --event-json '\"'{\\\"step\\\":\\\"final\\\",\\\"scope\\\":\\\"paper\\\",\\\"summary\\\":\\\"paper_strategy_ready: wrote matching JSON and Markdown strategy; strategy-only checks passed. Condition-dependent local scaling beat unsupported latent-count, broad-family, universal-superiority and chronology framings.\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Final qualification explicitly completed/qualified/true, independently read despite absent downstream_